        786.9022216796875,
        503.64410400390625
      ],
      "text": "No comparison against 6 months of isoniazid. Although the trial was conducted in low TB incidence countries, this is unlikely to affect relative effect of rifapentine + isoniazid compared with isoniazid monotherapy. Downgraded  a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
