      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        512.0440673828125,
        646.3858032226562,
        521.6441040039062
      ],
      "text": "Although the 95% CI of the RR is wide, the number of events was small and the CI of absolute effect is narrow. The result also met pre-stated non-inferiority margin. Not downgraded.  b",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
