        474.43487548828125,
        530.6441040039062
      ],
      "text": "Although the 95% CI of the RR is wide, the number of events was small and the CI of absolute effect is narrow. Not downgraded.  c",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
