    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        530.0440673828125,
        303.1730651855469,
        539.6441040039062
      ],
      "text": "An open-label design of the trial may have introduced ascertainment bias.  d",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
